      "**Not yet in AgenticOrg production:** the AgenticOrg release described here. It goes to production after the remaining work is merged, with each switch turned on separately.",
      "That is deliberate. Operators turn each switch on separately, for one merchant at a time, with a recorded way to turn it off again.",
      "## What OACP is not",
